One quick source-dive later:

The following all require basic skill.

Setting or disarming a trap
Reaching the floor (affects lots of things like using a pick-axe or 
stethescope, eating corpses, engraving, dropping breakable objects)
Moving rocks (if you could but your steed cannot).
Picking up objects
Looting
Dipping in fountains

The following vary according to your skill level:

Chance of using a saddle. Probablility of hitting with a weapon is reduced 
at unskilled or basic. Damage is increased at skilled or expert.


